{
    "title": "WEBTOON: Manga, Comics, Manhwa",
    "description": "Join the largest manga, comics, and manhwa community in the world with millions of fans and creators on WEBTOON!\r\n \r\n\r\nWhy you'll love WEBTOON:\r\n- Access thousands of episodes for FREE!\r\n- Explore the world\u2019s largest selection of webcomics spanning diverse genres like action, romance, thriller and everything in between.\r\n- Discover more content behind your favorite franchises like Batman: Wayne Family Adventures and Avatar: The Last Airbender.\r\n- Home to the original webcomics behind the TV and film adaptations of Tower of God, True Beauty, Sweet Home and Marry My Husband streaming on Netflix, Disney+, and Crunchyroll and more.\r\n- Engage with a thriving community of fellow enthusiasts and creators by subscribing to your favorite series and making your voice heard through the comments section, creator feed, and our audience-driven rating system!\r\n- Find your next favorite story with personalized series recommendations and curated reading collections.\r\n\r\n\r\nAre you a storyteller at heart? Use our CANVAS platform to publish your own webcomics and reach a global audience. Share your story and build your own community. WEBTOON is where you find your fandom.\r\n\r\nWebsite: www.webtoon.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join the largest manga, comics, and manhwa community in the world with millions of fans and creators on WEBTOON!<br> <br><br>Why you&#39;ll love WEBTOON:<br>- Access thousands of episodes for FREE!<br>- Explore the world\u2019s largest selection of webcomics spanning diverse genres like action, romance, thriller and everything in between.<br>- Discover more content behind your favorite franchises like Batman: Wayne Family Adventures and Avatar: The Last Airbender.<br>- Home to the original webcomics behind the TV and film adaptations of Tower of God, True Beauty, Sweet Home and Marry My Husband streaming on Netflix, Disney+, and Crunchyroll and more.<br>- Engage with a thriving community of fellow enthusiasts and creators by subscribing to your favorite series and making your voice heard through the comments section, creator feed, and our audience-driven rating system!<br>- Find your next favorite story with personalized series recommendations and curated reading collections.<br><br><br>Are you a storyteller at heart? Use our CANVAS platform to publish your own webcomics and reach a global audience. Share your story and build your own community. WEBTOON is where you find your fandom.<br><br>Website: www.webtoon.com",
